WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.469 --> 00:00:03.103
Hey, everybody.

00:00:03.103 --> 00:00:04.137
I'm James Gunn.

00:00:04.137 --> 00:00:07.173
I'm the co-CEO of D.C. studios.

00:00:07.173 --> 00:00:11.011
So as many of you know,
DC has been disconnected in film

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:12.645
and television for a long time.

00:00:12.645 --> 00:00:16.783
And it's one of, you know, our jobs,
mine and Peter's is to come in

00:00:16.783 --> 00:00:20.920
and make sure the DCU is connected
in film,

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:25.425
television, gaming and animation,
that the characters are consistent,

00:00:25.425 --> 00:00:29.029
played by the same actors,
and it works within one story.

00:00:29.029 --> 00:00:34.034
And if something is outside of that,
like Matt Reeves, Batman

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:38.705
or Todd Phillips, Joker or Teen Titans go
that it is clearly labeled

00:00:38.872 --> 00:00:43.543
as DC Elseworlds outside of the mainstream
DCU continuity.

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.613
Peter and I have gotten pretty lucky
in terms of the four projects

00:00:46.613 --> 00:00:48.114
that are coming out over the next year.

00:00:48.114 --> 00:00:50.483
First, we have Shazam Fury of the Gods.

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:54.220
Shazam has always been off
kind of in his own part of the DCU,

00:00:54.387 --> 00:00:56.523
so he connects very well.

00:00:56.523 --> 00:01:00.226
That moves directly into the Flash,
a fantastic movie

00:01:00.226 --> 00:01:04.497
that I really love
that resets the entire DC universe.

00:01:04.531 --> 00:01:09.169
Then to move into Blue Beetle,
a fantastic film about a kid

00:01:09.169 --> 00:01:13.606
who's a marvelous part of the DCU,
and then into Aquaman two,

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:16.543
which leads directly
into our next few projects,

00:01:16.543 --> 00:01:17.977
which I'm going to tell you about now.

00:01:17.977 --> 00:01:21.815
So Peter and I, along
with a group of very talented writers,

00:01:21.815 --> 00:01:27.587
have started to map out an 8 to 10 year
plan of what DC Studios will be in film.

00:01:27.754 --> 00:01:29.255
Television and gaming.

00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:32.459
This first chapter is called
Gods and Monsters.

00:01:32.625 --> 00:01:35.762
Now this what I'm about to tell you
is a part of the first chapter.

00:01:35.962 --> 00:01:38.231
It's not the entire first chapter.

00:01:38.231 --> 00:01:40.500
The first project is Creature Commandos.

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:43.570
Creature Commandos is an animated series.

00:01:43.570 --> 00:01:45.138
I've written all the episodes.

00:01:45.138 --> 00:01:47.841
Something we're going to do
that's a little bit different in DC

00:01:47.974 --> 00:01:52.245
is we're going to have characters move
into animation, out of animation, usually

00:01:52.245 --> 00:01:55.915
having the same actor play their voice
as who plays them in live action.

00:01:56.282 --> 00:01:58.518
The next project up is Waller.

00:01:58.618 --> 00:02:01.888
This is a story of Amanda
Waller, played by Viola Davis.

00:02:02.255 --> 00:02:05.758
Viola Davis is going to team up
with members of Team Peacemaker.

00:02:05.992 --> 00:02:09.262
And this is a story
that's been created by Christal Henry,

00:02:09.462 --> 00:02:13.166
who did Watchmen and Jeremy Carver,
who created the Doom Patrol.

00:02:13.199 --> 00:02:15.268
It is a fantastic story

00:02:15.401 --> 00:02:17.937
that's out of this world
and I can't wait for people to see it.

00:02:18.037 --> 00:02:18.872
Okay.

00:02:18.872 --> 00:02:22.442
Next up is the big one,
the true beginning of the DCU.

00:02:22.742 --> 00:02:24.844
This is called Superman Legacy.

00:02:24.844 --> 00:02:26.412
This is being written by me.

00:02:26.412 --> 00:02:29.115
I'm in the middle of it
and I'm having a great time doing it.

00:02:29.349 --> 00:02:34.320
And Superman will be released
into theaters July 11th, 2025.

00:02:34.554 --> 00:02:37.423
Okay, The next thing is a big premiere HBO

00:02:37.423 --> 00:02:40.860
television series called Lanterns.

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:44.931
This is a story of a couple of green
lanterns, Jon Stewart and Hal Jordan.

00:02:45.064 --> 00:02:47.233
And we have a few other lanterns
peppered in there.

00:02:47.233 --> 00:02:51.638
But this is really a terrestrial
based TV show, which is almost like true

00:02:51.638 --> 00:02:55.875
detective with a couple of green lanterns
who are space cops

00:02:56.176 --> 00:02:58.044
watching over precinct Earth.

00:02:58.044 --> 00:03:01.080
In it, they discover a terrifying mystery

00:03:01.247 --> 00:03:04.217
that ties into our larger
story of the DCU.

00:03:04.284 --> 00:03:06.786
Next is a big movie called The Authority.

00:03:06.786 --> 00:03:09.556
The authority is a passion
project of mine.

00:03:09.722 --> 00:03:13.259
It's based on the marvelous
Wildstorm characters we are now

00:03:13.259 --> 00:03:18.264
bringing into the DCU and will interact
with all of our primary DCU characters.

00:03:18.464 --> 00:03:22.669
The Authority are a group of superheroes
who think the world is broken

00:03:22.802 --> 00:03:25.338
and they want to fix it
by any means necessary.

00:03:25.371 --> 00:03:28.041
I think it's a very different
look at superheroes.

00:03:28.374 --> 00:03:31.411
We're doing a television
series called Paradise Lost.

00:03:31.678 --> 00:03:34.747
Paradise Lost is a story of Paradise
Island, usually known

00:03:34.747 --> 00:03:38.184
as Themyscira,
which is the birthplace of Wonder Woman.

00:03:38.251 --> 00:03:40.887
It's almost like Game of Thrones
with Westeros,

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:43.890
but with all of the inhabitants
of Paradise Island.

00:03:43.923 --> 00:03:48.828
The introduction of the DCU
as Batman is the brave and the Bold.

00:03:48.861 --> 00:03:53.866
The Brave and the Bold is the story of
Batman and his actual son, Damian Wayne.

00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:57.203
This is based on Grant Morrison's
great comic book run.

00:03:57.370 --> 00:03:59.639
Damian Wayne is my favorite Robin.

00:03:59.806 --> 00:04:03.276
He's a little assassin
who Batman tries to get in line.

00:04:03.276 --> 00:04:05.612
And so this is the story
of the two of them

00:04:05.845 --> 00:04:09.148
and the beginning
of sort of the Bat-Family in the DCU.

00:04:09.482 --> 00:04:11.985
Next up is a TV series called Booster
Gold.

00:04:12.018 --> 00:04:15.121
Booster Gold is one of comics
really popular cult heroes.

00:04:15.121 --> 00:04:16.623
He is a fascinating guy.

00:04:16.623 --> 00:04:21.661
He's a loser from the future
who uses future technology to come back

00:04:21.661 --> 00:04:25.031
to present day and become a superhero
so that people will love him.

00:04:25.231 --> 00:04:30.403
It is basically the superhero story
of imposter syndrome on an HBO Max series.

00:04:30.603 --> 00:04:32.171
One of my favorite comic book series

00:04:32.171 --> 00:04:35.908
from last year was Tom King's run
on Supergirl, Woman of Tomorrow.

00:04:35.942 --> 00:04:40.780
And so we're going to turn that
into a big science fiction epic film now.

00:04:40.980 --> 00:04:45.451
Superman is a guy who was sent to Earth
and raised by loving parents.

00:04:45.551 --> 00:04:47.387
We're Supergirl in this story.

00:04:47.387 --> 00:04:51.524
She is a character
who was raised on a chunk of Krypton.

00:04:51.624 --> 00:04:55.328
She watched everybody around her
perish in some terrible way.

00:04:55.461 --> 00:04:57.730
So she's a much more jaded character.

00:04:57.730 --> 00:04:59.232
And that brings me to Swamp Thing.

00:04:59.232 --> 00:05:02.335
The last thing we're going to talk about,
a very dark horror

00:05:02.335 --> 00:05:06.906
story in the origins of the monster
who is Swamp Thing.

00:05:07.173 --> 00:05:10.143
And although it's totally outside
of the rest of the DCU,

00:05:10.310 --> 00:05:12.812
it will still feed
into the rest of the stories.

00:05:13.112 --> 00:05:16.215
Anyway, those are the stories
that I can tell you about right now.

00:05:16.249 --> 00:05:18.951
I've loved the DC characters
since I was a child.

00:05:19.185 --> 00:05:21.154
They're incredibly important to me.

00:05:21.154 --> 00:05:24.757
I knew that this was a once in a lifetime
opportunity to do something

00:05:25.091 --> 00:05:26.192
very different.

00:05:26.192 --> 00:05:29.462
One of the things that's very important
for me in all of these movies

00:05:29.462 --> 00:05:32.699
and TV series
is that the director's vision

00:05:32.699 --> 00:05:36.803
and the vision of the writers
and all of the creators is unique.

00:05:37.203 --> 00:05:38.538
There's something special.

00:05:38.538 --> 00:05:40.907
Storytelling is always king.

00:05:40.907 --> 00:05:42.508
That's all that matters to us.

00:05:42.508 --> 00:05:43.943
And I want to be true to those stories.

00:05:43.943 --> 00:05:45.478
I want to be true to you guys

00:05:45.478 --> 00:05:48.514
and really give you something different
than you've ever seen before.

00:05:48.514 --> 00:05:50.550
And we thank you, everybody.

00:05:50.550 --> 00:05:52.018
I appreciate you watching.

00:05:52.018 --> 00:05:55.388
I hope this was exciting for you
because it's really exciting for me.

00:05:55.588 --> 00:05:56.589
And I can't wait to start

00:05:56.589 --> 00:06:00.093
to dive into these stories
with you guys on this grand adventure.

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:01.894
Thank you so much.

00:06:01.894 --> 00:06:03.363
Welcome back, everyone. Is Charlie.

00:06:03.363 --> 00:06:07.166
So James Gunn just announced
the new DC Phase one or DC Chapter

00:06:07.166 --> 00:06:11.671
one, Gods and Monsters of their next
ten years of what they're calling the DCU,

00:06:11.671 --> 00:06:13.873
The DC Universe.
So we'll break it all down.

00:06:13.873 --> 00:06:16.275
There's a whole bunch of new movies.
They're rebooting everything.

00:06:16.275 --> 00:06:17.944
There's a bunch of TV series
they announced.

00:06:17.944 --> 00:06:20.313
If you're brand new to the channel,
of course I'll be doing videos

00:06:20.313 --> 00:06:23.750
for all these new TV series,
all the episodes, all the new movies

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:27.086
that they're going to be doing,
just like I do for all the other DC stuff.

00:06:27.086 --> 00:06:31.557
But the first big thing is they're
calling it the DCU, not the DCU anymore.

00:06:31.557 --> 00:06:34.694
And technically there'll be
a couple projects, like a couple of movies

00:06:34.694 --> 00:06:37.897
and series before the true DCU is James
Gunn is calling.

00:06:37.897 --> 00:06:39.599
It picks up
because like there are a couple of movies

00:06:39.599 --> 00:06:42.001
coming out this year
that are still set in the Snyder verse,

00:06:42.001 --> 00:06:44.771
like You have Shazam Fury of the Gods,
which is coming out really shortly.

00:06:44.771 --> 00:06:46.539
I just did a bunch of trailer videos
for that.

00:06:46.539 --> 00:06:48.174
Then we have the Flash movie
in the summer,

00:06:48.174 --> 00:06:51.911
which is meant to reset the entire DCU

00:06:51.911 --> 00:06:53.880
because they are doing
a version of Flashpoint.

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:55.748
Then the Blue Beetle movie will happen.

00:06:55.748 --> 00:06:57.383
Everybody's been pretty hype about that.

00:06:57.383 --> 00:07:00.753
And then Aquaman to the Lost Kingdom
at the end of the year,

00:07:00.753 --> 00:07:04.390
and that'll be the end of the Snyder
verse Justice League line of movies.

00:07:04.390 --> 00:07:07.293
There are a couple of DCU
Connected TV series

00:07:07.293 --> 00:07:11.230
that will happen on HBO before that,
like Peacemaker Spin Offs and such.

00:07:11.230 --> 00:07:12.732
I'll explain those in a second.

00:07:12.732 --> 00:07:15.902
But the first proper movie
that they're releasing as part of the DCU

00:07:15.902 --> 00:07:19.205
will be the new Superman movie
that he was hyping up a little while ago.

00:07:19.205 --> 00:07:23.543
It's titled Superman Legacy Release Date
July 11th, 2025.

00:07:23.543 --> 00:07:28.314
So that's like the official beginning
of the new James Gunn DCU chapter one.

00:07:28.314 --> 00:07:31.784
They said it'd be heavily influenced
by all Stars Superman, which confirms why

00:07:31.784 --> 00:07:35.288
he was reading that comic book and posted
the picture a couple of days ago.

00:07:35.288 --> 00:07:36.656
It'll be a completely new actor.

00:07:36.656 --> 00:07:39.992
It kind of explains why they are recasting
Henry Cavill because they want it

00:07:39.992 --> 00:07:43.029
to be like a Superman year
or two or so earlier in his career.

00:07:43.029 --> 00:07:46.299
Maybe not necessarily year
to the next big movie after that will be

00:07:46.299 --> 00:07:49.335
their new Batman movie called Batman
The Brave and the Bold.

00:07:49.335 --> 00:07:51.537
Everybody Remembering the Brave
and the Bold TV series.

00:07:51.537 --> 00:07:54.640
It will be completely separate
from Robert Pattinson's Batman movie.

00:07:54.640 --> 00:07:56.075
That'll be an Elseworlds story.

00:07:56.075 --> 00:07:57.343
And they are calling anything

00:07:57.343 --> 00:08:00.480
that's not directly connected
to what they're calling the DCU.

00:08:00.480 --> 00:08:03.249
True Elseworlds
and it'll be titled as such.

00:08:03.249 --> 00:08:07.386
They'll be recasting a different version
of Batman and it'll be a true live action.

00:08:07.386 --> 00:08:11.357
Bat-Family focused mostly
on his relationship with Damian Wayne.

00:08:11.357 --> 00:08:12.692
Like live action Damian Wayne.

00:08:12.692 --> 00:08:15.194
Finally,
he said specifically it'd be influenced

00:08:15.194 --> 00:08:16.929
on Grant Morrison's run,
where he introduced

00:08:16.929 --> 00:08:20.766
Damian Wayne and called Damian
his favorite robin of all the robins.

00:08:20.766 --> 00:08:21.901
But he said Bat-Family.

00:08:21.901 --> 00:08:23.603
So that means that Nightwing
is probably in it.

00:08:23.603 --> 00:08:27.173
Tim Drake is also probably in it somehow,
probably some of the other characters.

00:08:27.173 --> 00:08:31.277
It's a very big Bat-Family they announced
they're doing a new Supergirl movie

00:08:31.277 --> 00:08:33.212
and it's called Supergirl
Woman of Tomorrow.

00:08:33.212 --> 00:08:35.281
Based on Tom King's recent run,

00:08:35.281 --> 00:08:37.316
you can actually go read that comic book
right now.

00:08:37.316 --> 00:08:38.584
It'll be inspired by that.

00:08:38.584 --> 00:08:40.653
They didn't say if it be the Sasha Collar

00:08:40.653 --> 00:08:42.421
version of Supergirl
that they're introducing

00:08:42.421 --> 00:08:44.357
in The Flash movie
or a completely new one.

00:08:44.357 --> 00:08:44.757
But they made

00:08:44.757 --> 00:08:46.826
it sound like it's
going to be a completely new one,

00:08:46.826 --> 00:08:48.861
and they will
just recast the new Supergirl

00:08:48.861 --> 00:08:50.263
and they get ready for that movie.

00:08:50.263 --> 00:08:53.432
But it won't come till well
after the new Superman movie.

00:08:53.432 --> 00:08:57.870
They're doing a new Swamp Thing movie is
like a true horror movie inside the DCU.

00:08:57.870 --> 00:09:00.039
They'll totally be very different
from the other movies,

00:09:00.039 --> 00:09:04.143
but it'll still be connected to the larger
DCU story that they're moving forward.

00:09:04.143 --> 00:09:06.112
They're doing a movie
based on the Authority,

00:09:06.112 --> 00:09:08.114
which is actually a Wildstorm team,

00:09:08.114 --> 00:09:10.449
and it's primarily
meant to bring the Wildstorm characters

00:09:10.449 --> 00:09:14.253
into the live action DCU
because they bought Jim Lee's Wildstorm

00:09:14.253 --> 00:09:18.457
Comics a long time ago when they hired
Jim Lee or technically rehired him.

00:09:18.457 --> 00:09:20.359
This is like 20 plus years ago.

00:09:20.359 --> 00:09:21.160
Those Wildstorm

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:24.330
characters have kind of been
in this weird, nebulous type of continuity

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:27.600
where they tried to bring Wildstorm
and integrated with the DC Universe.

00:09:27.600 --> 00:09:29.802
Now they're doing that in live action
form.

00:09:29.802 --> 00:09:32.138
A lot of their characters
are meant to be analogs

00:09:32.138 --> 00:09:35.207
of Main DC characters,
so we'll see how they treat them.

00:09:35.207 --> 00:09:38.177
But like James Gunn says, they're a team
that thinks the world is broken

00:09:38.177 --> 00:09:39.745
and they're trying to fix it.

00:09:39.745 --> 00:09:41.347
For all the big TV series
that they're doing,

00:09:41.347 --> 00:09:43.382
they're all meant to be big budget
HBO series.

00:09:43.382 --> 00:09:47.320
Kind of like Peacemaker was the first new
one as part of the DCU will be the New

00:09:47.320 --> 00:09:51.390
Green Lantern series called Lanterns,
and it takes place mostly on Earth.

00:09:51.390 --> 00:09:53.259
It's going to be a buddy cop series

00:09:53.259 --> 00:09:57.063
like True Detective in the DC Universe
with Hal Jordan and Jon Stewart.

00:09:57.063 --> 00:09:58.965
If you remember several years ago
when they announced

00:09:58.965 --> 00:10:01.000
they were doing a Green Lantern Corps
movie, people are like,

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:02.969
Why don't you just do True
Detective in space?

00:10:02.969 --> 00:10:04.203
Turns out they're doing it.

00:10:04.203 --> 00:10:08.374
But as a big budget HBO series supposedly
this is meant to be completely different

00:10:08.374 --> 00:10:11.477
from what Greg Berlanti was doing
with his Green Lantern series

00:10:11.477 --> 00:10:12.812
with a bunch of other green lanterns.

00:10:12.812 --> 00:10:15.014
There will be other lanterns on it,
he said.

00:10:15.014 --> 00:10:17.016
But I think creatively
they're just like a bunch

00:10:17.016 --> 00:10:18.884
of different people working on it. Now.

00:10:18.884 --> 00:10:21.587
There'll be a Peacemaker spinoff
focused on Amanda Waller.

00:10:21.587 --> 00:10:22.588
He teased that a while ago.

00:10:22.588 --> 00:10:23.522
It just called Waller.

00:10:23.522 --> 00:10:24.357
Right now,

00:10:24.357 --> 00:10:26.692
it sounds like they're treating it
like Peacemaker Season two

00:10:26.692 --> 00:10:29.428
because it spins out of Peacemaker
season one.

00:10:29.428 --> 00:10:32.465
Most of the Peacemaker
characters will cross over into it.

00:10:32.465 --> 00:10:34.000
I don't know if this means
that they're not doing

00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:36.469
Peacemaker Season two
and they'll just do the Wallace series

00:10:36.469 --> 00:10:38.671
or they're also doing Peacemaker
Season two.

00:10:38.671 --> 00:10:40.473
He was really clear about that.

00:10:40.473 --> 00:10:43.643
They're doing a Wonder Woman series,
but it doesn't star Wonder Woman.

00:10:43.643 --> 00:10:44.243
It's called

00:10:44.243 --> 00:10:48.614
Paradise Lost, and it'll be set before
Wonder Woman is born on Theme Obscura.

00:10:48.614 --> 00:10:51.517
And it'll be kind of like Game of Thrones
in the DC Universe.

00:10:51.517 --> 00:10:55.454
But on Paradise Island, Wonder
Woman was born about 5000 years ago.

00:10:55.454 --> 00:10:58.791
So that gives you an idea for the timeline
of when things take place during it.

00:10:58.791 --> 00:11:01.794
Now it kind of makes sense
why they couldn't do Wonder Woman three

00:11:01.794 --> 00:11:02.962
Why they canceled that movie.

00:11:02.962 --> 00:11:05.631
And Patty Jenkins said there was no way
forward for the storyline.

00:11:05.631 --> 00:11:07.199
There was no way for them to work it out

00:11:07.199 --> 00:11:10.936
because their next big story with Wonder
Woman takes place way before she was born.

00:11:10.936 --> 00:11:12.538
They're doing a Booster Gold series.

00:11:12.538 --> 00:11:13.439
They've been talking about

00:11:13.439 --> 00:11:17.176
doing a booster gold project,
a movie, a TV series for a long time now.

00:11:17.176 --> 00:11:19.078
It's cool to see him finally get his due,

00:11:19.078 --> 00:11:22.581
and they're doing an animated Creature
Commando series with characters

00:11:22.581 --> 00:11:24.450
that will also cross over
into live action.

00:11:24.450 --> 00:11:25.351
Kind of like Marvel's

00:11:25.351 --> 00:11:29.188
What If series, where the characters
are played by the movie actors as well.

00:11:29.188 --> 00:11:31.857
Creature Commandos was a team
put together during World

00:11:31.857 --> 00:11:34.860
War Two of a bunch of monsters
called Project M.

00:11:34.860 --> 00:11:36.862
It started out
with Frankenstein's monster,

00:11:36.862 --> 00:11:39.298
a vampire in a werewolf,
and then in present day,

00:11:39.298 --> 00:11:42.568
they just continue cycling the roster
with a bunch of different monsters.

00:11:42.568 --> 00:11:45.304
They did address the fate of Ezra miller
because there's been a lot of questions

00:11:45.304 --> 00:11:46.706
about whether or not
they're getting rid of him

